{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652860/extras/06eafc198e0cc49dca97d623f10584f6.avif?t=1767000140\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652860/extras_big/06eafc198e0cc49dca97d623f10584f6.avif?t=1767000140 width=800 height=450 /></span>&quot;Touhou Eternal Frontier&quot; \u2013 A 3D Touhou action indie game set in a futuristic cityIllustration by: Nyom-sama&quot;Touhou Eternal Frontier&quot; is a Touhou fan-made indie 3D game created by 9nahitoproject.- Simple Controls -1. Select your player and start2. Press ESC3. The player will spawn, allowing you to explore freely4. Defeat the floating bots to level up and unlock achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added explanations to the in-game lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >info- Enemies have level and HP indicators.- Defeat enemies to level up and unlock achievements.- If the game is running slowly, try restarting it.- There is only one portal to return to the lobby in each map.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"LevelUP20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/946abc6376d606c819dff4a786ad766902731f49.jpg"},{"name":"LevelUP100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/e035b1bec27790c5c21efdf00c144e4041283ffd.jpg"},{"name":"LevelUP500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/7e67ffe43fe9fcbaf3d9da853a4affeb57931093.jpg"},{"name":"LevelUP1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/a2aa4caa9881984b89354283713aab05d169b7c4.jpg"},{"name":"LevelUP5000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/ec1bc990de0ca5797c3af7c32ed744287834f269.jpg"},{"name":"GameStart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam